tps://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-10T14:09:23Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T14:09:23Z","body":"What changes did you expect us to see when we test it?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4224335788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4224940180","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116049#issuecomment-4224940180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116049","id":4224940180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7703iU","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-10T15:44:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T15:44:11Z","body":"I've done some simple tests and the alpha channel handling works much better now:\r\n| BC3 | BC7 CVTT | BC7 Betsy |\r\n|------|------------|------------|\r\n| <img width=\"1244\" height=\"1245\" alt=\"bc3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/efcce9da-2659-4b20-9bd5-2f5461d65c1f\" /> | <img width=\"1242\" height=\"1238\" alt=\"bc7cpu\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56d70fd1-f3bd-4f67-9e2a-85dc85d47909\" /> | <img width=\"1252\" height=\"1246\" alt=\"bc7gpu\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a85da74-84cc-4459-9dbe-27dff38afd94\" /> |\r\n\r\nOne thing I've noticed is that the setup time for the compressor (on first import) takes much longer with this PR (up to 10s).\r\n\r\nIn terms of handling worst-case scenarios (4x4 image with varying colors) it does a really good job for the most part, though certain cases seem to confuse it:\r\n\r\n4 colors in a 4x4 block, looks great:\r\n<img width=\"590\" height=\"332\" alt=\"bc7gpu_worstcase0\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7632eeb9-663c-4222-8c68-0e1cd2c8218f\" />\r\n\r\ngrayscale gradient in a 4x4 block, looks great:\r\n| CVTT | Betsy |\r\n|--------|-------|\r\n| <img width=\"589\" height=\"334\" alt=\"bc7cpu_worstcase0\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/226134c8-593e-43c4-b22b-6ae3535900eb\" /> | <img width=\"587\" height=\"340\" alt=\"bc7gpu_worstcase1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/345eab5a-1c1e-4de6-b371-bd319f79751f\" /> |\r\n\r\n4 colors, each with 3 stages of luminance in a 4x4 block:\r\n| Original | CVTT | Betsy |\r\n|----------|-------|-------|\r\n|<img width=\"579\" height=\"335\" alt=\"uncomp_worst2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/073daf99-5566-4e8d-a0f2-a7b9b6eebb0d\" />|<img width=\"577\" height=\"327\" alt=\"bc7cpu_worstcase2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b7c3297-7a5d-4ff6-81bd-49131f565384\" /> | <img width=\"591\" height=\"340\" alt=\"bc7gpu_worstcase2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36419f2d-6ea2-4018-a476-c677e627a436\" />|\r\n\r\nTo be clear, I'm not at all expecting this to look like the original. This is an absolutely worst-case scenario that makes it impossible to replicate the original data by any compressor simply due to how the BC7 format works.\r\n\r\nI've also begun to test this on real-life examples (mostly from Polyhaven) and it looks like textures with channel-specific data (like ORM) suffer from heavy artifacting, even more than with BC1. I will post more test results soon","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4224940180/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4245720222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116049#issuecomment-4245720222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116049","id":4245720222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79EIye","user":{"login":"tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven","html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-14T16:59:40Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T16:59:40Z","body":"Well, at least alpha is looking better.   That was really the main focus(through lots of frustrating tears).  Sounds like I need to try and reduce the shader size though to improve startup delay.  I had noticed that as well.\r\n\r\nIf you have specific cases that are poor from poly haven please share links.  I basically made a bunch of alpha images and have been comparing cvtt and compressonator. I just made a project that compresses via both and then generate heat maps for errors from the reference.\r\n\r\nMy results definitely shows a mix of meeting cvtt,. sometimes better, sometimes worse.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4245720222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4245812372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116049#issuecomment-4245812372","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116049","id":4245812372,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79EfSU","user":{"login":"tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven","html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-14T17:15:31Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T17:15:31Z","body":"I want to split it up more into multiple passes but I don't think the other Betsy shaders work that way so I'd avoided doing it.   I suspect you could get better occupancy though....\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4245812372/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4254269254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116049#issuecomment-4254269254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116049","id":4254269254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79kv9G","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T17:52:32Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T17:58:27Z","body":"> If you have specific cases that are poor from poly haven please share links. I basically made a bunch of alpha images and have been comparing cvtt and compressonator. I just made a project that compresses via both and then generate heat maps for errors from the reference.\r\n\r\nAs an example: https://polyhaven.com/a/rubber_tiles (1024x1024)\r\nCompressing the ORM texture as BC7 shows visible blocky artifacts\r\n| BC1 | BC7 |\r\n|-----|------|\r\n| <img width=\"1531\" height=\"1248\" alt=\"bc1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f83168e-2958-46b4-a17a-df7b7407a516\" /> | <img width=\"1486\" height=\"1188\" alt=\"bc7\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f55d4cb-a2d4-41d4-b6d7-c838cea1cf48\" />|\r\n\r\nhttps://polyhaven.com/a/slab_tiles (1024x1024)\r\nHere I've compressed all textures (aldebo/normal/ORM) as BC7:\r\n| BC1 + BC5 Normal | BC7 |\r\n|-----|------|\r\n| <img width=\"1217\" height=\"909\" alt=\"bc1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d83c305-10f1-47b5-a655-930780571f69\" /> | <img width=\"1463\" height=\"968\" alt=\"bc7\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d5a4496-f369-4461-88d4-d3e1bee08a26\" /> |\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4254269254/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]